Package: sunshine
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libcap2-bin, udev, kmod,
 qt6-svg-plugins
Recommends: avahi-daemon, xdg-desktop-portal
Suggests: mesa-va-drivers
Description: self-hosted game stream host for Moonlight
 Sunshine streams games and the desktop to Moonlight clients. It captures
 with KMS, X11, Wayland or the XDG portal, and encodes with VA-API,
 Vulkan or software encoders. It emulates mouse, keyboard and gamepads.
 .
 Start it as a user service: systemctl --user enable --now sunshine.
 This build has no CUDA (NVENC capture) support.
